WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:09.860
We left early for Disneyland.

2
00:00:09.861 --> 00:00:14.539
It was a long drive!

3
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.507
Bada: How long will it take, Mom?

4
00:00:17.508 --> 00:00:20.729
Mom: Oh, about six hours.

5
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:25.326
Hana: Six hours? That's a long time!

6
00:00:25.327 --> 00:00:29.989
Mom: California is a very big state.

7
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.955
Bada: I'm bored!

8
00:00:31.956 --> 00:00:33.749
Mom: Let's play a game!

9
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.904
Do you know "I Spy?"

10
00:00:35.905 --> 00:00:37.487
Hana & Bada: Yes.

11
00:00:37.488 --> 00:00:39.340
Mom: Let me start.

12
00:00:39.341 --> 00:00:48.016
Mom: Umm . . . I spy with my little eye something that begins with C.

13
00:00:48.017 --> 00:00:50.248
Hana: Is it carpet?

14
00:00:50.249 --> 00:00:52.141
Bada: Is it coffee?

15
00:00:52.142 --> 00:00:55.595
Mom: Yes! Bada, it's your turn.

16
00:00:55.596 --> 00:01:05.185
Bada: I spy with my little eye, something that [n3@begins with . . . umm . . . A.

17
00:01:05.186 --> 00:01:07.602
Hana: Are we lost, Mom?

18
00:01:07.603 --> 00:01:10.381
Mom: I hope not, Hana.

19
00:01:10.382 --> 00:01:13.287
Bada: Mom! A man is coming.

20
00:01:13.288 --> 00:01:16.164
Man: Can I help you?

21
00:01:16.165 --> 00:01:18.422
Mom: We're driving to Disneyland.

22
00:01:18.423 --> 00:01:20.840
Which way do we go?

23
00:01:20.841 --> 00:01:22.470
Man: Turn right at the light.

24
00:01:22.471 --> 00:01:24.618
Then get on the highway.

25
00:01:24.619 --> 00:01:27.643
Man: Keep going straight and you will reach Anaheim.

26
00:01:27.644 --> 00:01:31.236
Mom: Thank you very much!

27
00:01:31.237 --> 00:01:34.155
Mom: Look, kids! We're in Anaheim!

28
00:01:34.156 --> 00:01:37.127
Mom: We're almost at Disneyland now.

29
00:01:37.128 --> 00:01:40.316
Bada: Look at that car, Mom!

30
00:01:40.317 --> 00:01:44.372
Hana: Maybe he's a movie star!

31
00:01:44.373 --> 00:01:48.067
Hana: We're here! We're at Disneyland!

32
00:01:48.068 --> 00:01:52.392
Hana: Oh, I can't wait to go on the rides!

33
00:01:52.393 --> 00:01:55.140
Bada: Will I meet Mickey Mouse?

34
00:01:55.141 --> 00:02:01.193
Mom: Of course! And Goofy and Donald Duck too!

35
00:02:01.194 --> 00:02:05.573
The drive was very long, but it was worth it.

36
00:02:05.574 --> 00:02:09.665
Disneyland is like a dream!
